    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A brief release—then an adult voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER WOMAN 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nia. Come here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER WOMAN 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Another adult calls a child away."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CHILD 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER WOMAN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Come along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "One by one, the children are removed from Mary’s orbit."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary watches a child who was laughing beside her moments ago get pulled away."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "That hurts more than an insult."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No adult answers him."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE GOSSIP RHYTHM RETURNS"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A restrained fragment of “Welcome to Nazareth” lives underneath the dialogue, not celebratory now, but tight and repetitive."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Before the wedding—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s what I heard."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ay, everybody knows Joseph knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then why—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Don’t ask me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They say she claims—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "God."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A few villagers react."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "God?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s what she said."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Convenient."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "In Scene 1, everybody knowing everybody was comedy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now everybody thinks they know enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MARY’S FRIENDS"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Shira moves to Mary immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "She is not completely all right."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shira stays."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Adina joins them, scanning the marketplace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ADINA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is getting worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That is not helpful."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ADINA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not trying to be helpful. I’m trying to be accurate."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s Talia’s job."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Talia arrives."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What is my job?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Being accurate."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then Adina is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Dafna stares at her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nobody here understands comfort."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A small breath of humor. Then—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "You believe her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The question is aimed at Talia."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Talia does not pretend certainty she does not have."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I believe Mary told us what happened to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "That is not what I asked."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "So you don’t believe it either."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I didn’t say that."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Then what are you saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Talia steps slightly closer to Mary."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m saying you weren’t there."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Neither were you."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Talia takes the point."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Which means neither of us gets to humiliate her over something we did not see."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks at her."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Talia gives the smallest nod."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "She stays."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "JOSEPH’S FRIENDS"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Levi, Malachi, Caleb, and Ezra enter or emerge from the marketplace."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "They see the crowd. Then Joseph. Then Mary holding Joseph’s hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Levi stops."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re really doing this."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "After everything you told us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You believe her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Levi lowers his voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then help me understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can’t."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Levi did not expect that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Not all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But I know enough to know she told me the truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m trying to protect you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then let me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is me telling you what I chose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Levi does not like it. But he hears him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Caleb nods and moves to Joseph’s side."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EZRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There are still several things about this that make absolutely no sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ezra."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EZRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There are."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EZRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And you’re comfortable with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph almost smiles at the absurdity."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ezra did not expect that either."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But understanding everything and knowing what I need to do are not always the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ezra considers it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MALACHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s enough for today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Malachi stands beside Joseph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ezra hesitates, then joins them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Levi remains slightly apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE PUBLIC TEST"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A Villager Man steps forward. Not a villain. A neighbor who believes he is saying the obvious thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph. You don’t have to do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Carry another man’s shame."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The marketplace quiets."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary stiffens."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph remains controlled."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You don’t know what you’re talking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Everybody knows what happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Everybody knows what they heard."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The Villager Man looks at him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And you’re willing to throw away your name for this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Levi reacts to the language."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My name isn’t worth much if I have to destroy hers to protect it."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The Villager Man turns toward Mary."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is what they’re saying true?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph does not step in front of Mary."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary steps forward herself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told the truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "About an angel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Some villagers stare. A few whisper. One or two may laugh under their breath."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER WOMAN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And you expect all of us to believe that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks around at people she has known all her life."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That surprises them."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can’t make you believe me."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But I will not call what happened to me a lie just to make you comfortable."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "This is Mary’s public choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "JOSEPH TRIES TO FIX IT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The whispers restart."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Did you hear—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She admitted—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph actually—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Enough!"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary gently touches his arm."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They’re talking about you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can explain—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "To all of them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks around."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Every face has an opinion."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You don’t have to answer everyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I want to."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But you can’t build your way out of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It lands without cruelty."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks at the village."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "For once, he lets the problem remain unsolved."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "NIA AND SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Nia and Simon have watched all of this from nearby."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why is everybody angry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No one answers."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s still a baby."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The simple line hangs there."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We were just singing."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "An adult calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER WOMAN 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nia does not move immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER WOMAN 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Come."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nia looks at Mary."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary gives her a small reassuring smile."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Nia goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Simon follows, looking back once."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE SAME TOWN — DIVIDED"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The ensemble reorganizes without becoming a cartoon of good people and bad people."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Near Mary and Joseph: Shira, Adina, Dafna, Talia, Caleb, Malachi, and Ezra."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "At a distance: skeptical villagers, whisperers, people who simply do not know what to think."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Levi remains between the two groups."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Nobody wins the argument."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Nazareth does not apologize."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The gossip rhythm begins to peak."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph knows—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Before the wedding—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "An angel—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A child—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "God—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Can you believe—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VILLAGER 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Everybody knows—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "BOOM."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A Roman drum cuts through the marketplace."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Everything stops."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "BOOM."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A trumpet or unmistakable imperial sound."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Rome does not care about Nazareth’s scandal."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "ROME ENTERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The Roman Announcer enters as though his arrival is unquestionably the most important event of the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "People of Nazareth!"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A few villagers are still murmuring."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "People."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Of."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nazareth."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The village quiets."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He unrolls the decree."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "By decree of Caesar Augustus—"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A villager groans."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The Announcer stops and looks directly at them."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Your enthusiasm is noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We haven’t even heard it yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And still you’ve disappointed Rome."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A few villagers react."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A census shall be taken. Every household is to be registered according to family line and ancestral city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Immediate murmuring."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We have to travel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "If your ancestral city is elsewhere, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who pays for the journey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excellent question."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You do."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The village groans."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You will present yourself, your household, and the required family information in the appropriate city."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "VILLAGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "When?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Immediately?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It is a wonderful word."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It means now."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The marketplace explodes into practical anxiety: counting, packing, questions, arguments."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Govern yourselves accordingly."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He begins to roll the decree."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROMAN ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thank yooou."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He exits as the Roman drum resumes."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "BETHLEHEM"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The marketplace is now moving for an entirely different reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks at Joseph."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He is doing the calculation before she asks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Bethlehem."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary knows what that means: distance, travel, timing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "When do we leave?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks at her."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "His first instinct is to protect her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mary—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "When?"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He sees that she is not asking whether she is going."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "She has already decided that."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph exhales."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "As soon as we can."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary nods."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Their hands find each other again."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Around them, Nazareth prepares to move."
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "text": "END SCENE 9"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "NOTES"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Scene 10 setup: Mary’s “When do we leave?” makes clear that the next conflict is not whether she will go, but how Joseph will handle the danger, logistics, and loss of control on the journey."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Scene 9 should feel like a deliberate mirror of"
    }
  ]
}
